<P STYLE="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:1pt; margin-left:2.00em; text-indent:-2.00em; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">(b)&#8194;&#8201;&#8202;the subscription for the Dogotix Ordinary Shares and the Dogotix Warrants by the Executive
